From: MeemeeLab <57629983+MeemeeLab@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mfd: simple-mfd-i2c: add X-Powers AXP2101

Expose the AXP2101 PMU as a plain regmap so the poweroff and backlight
child drivers can share it. Originally from M5Stack's CoreMP135 BSP
(m5stack/CoreMP135_buildroot-external-st), rebased onto 6.18.
---
diff --git a/drivers/mfd/simple-mfd-i2c.c b/drivers/mfd/simple-mfd-i2c.c
index 9f911afaf..1dd624842 100644
--- a/drivers/mfd/simple-mfd-i2c.c
+++ b/drivers/mfd/simple-mfd-i2c.c
@@ -115,6 +115,7 @@ static const struct of_device_id simple_mfd_i2c_of_match[] = {
 	{ .compatible = "fsl,lx2160aqds-fpga" },
 	{ .compatible = "fsl,lx2160ardb-fpga" },
 	{ .compatible = "kontron,sl28cpld" },
+	{ .compatible = "x-powers,axp2101" },
 	{ .compatible = "maxim,max5970", .data = &maxim_max5970},
 	{ .compatible = "maxim,max5978", .data = &maxim_max5970},
 	{ .compatible = "maxim,max77705-battery", .data = &maxim_mon_max77705},
